Author: JimmyShi22 <417711026@qq.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 13 14:21:51 2026 +0800

    Add the frozen interface of the norm gain and bias parameter tables
    
    The new module fixes the identity, the row mapping and the plan counts of the
    two parameter tables the norm output tail will consume. Each identity binds the
    external model identity, the asset-table identity, the committed encoded-table
    reader, the parameter row and width, the admitted i32 range and the explicit
    mapping-assumption flag; the digest covers every field. The tables plan carries
    the gain and bias identities with the per-table column draw and seed counts,
    allows two rows of one committed table or two separate tables, and rejects
    wrong versions, malformed shapes, duplicated rows, out-of-domain ranges and
    out-of-budget counts.
    
    The module neither builds a table nor consumes an evaluation yet; the frozen
    contract for asset binding, opening and ledger accounting, transcript order and
    the relation consumption hooks is recorded in the task records.
    
    partial progress

